WEBVTT

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:15.530
You can come
observe us!

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:15.530
<b>We'd love for
 you to join!!</b>

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:15.530
<b>We want to cheer you on!
 Please feel free to
request us anytime!
We're in the old A/V room.</b>

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:15.530
<b>Cheerleading Club</b>

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:12.350
There!

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.530
The cheerleading club! 
We want to cheer you on!

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.480
The cheerleading club!

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.480
It sounds amazing just to say it!

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.860
Come on, let's go to the next spot.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.860
Um... Are you from the cheer club?

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:30.140
Yes! We're in the cheer club!

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.770
Um, I'd like to request...

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:33.340
I'm Hatoya from the cheer club!

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:34.330
Um...

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:35.340
Cheer! Club!

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.180
Hey!

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:50.020
<b>Anima Yell!</b>

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.980
<b>A/V Room</b>

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.980
Cheer Club
We'd love for you to join!!

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.860
We got a request!

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:15.200
The request came from 
the manga research club.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.100
Huh? It's not an athletic club?

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.640
Then we won't need our uniforms.

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:21.720
I wonder if we'll be able 
to help them out...

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:23.700
You're all just accepting this?

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:27.830
We basically do anything 
we can to help people out.

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:30.990
This must be a first for you, Hanawa-san.

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:32.890
Hana... Yes...

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:34.750
Isn't this exciting, Hanawa-chan?

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.010
It's Kana!

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.750
Do you have time after 
school today, Hanawa-chan?

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.990
<i>Kana</i> has some free time!

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:43.590
That's great, Hanawa-san.

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:45.100
Ha...nawa...

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.550
Um... Ha... Kana-chan—

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:48.280
Hanawa!

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.080
Wa?

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:52.980
I-I'm sorry!

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:56.620
Sorry. It's all because 
Kohane called you that first.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:00.170
Why are you apologizing for Kohane?

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:02.160
You almost seem like...

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.840
Oh, like her mom?

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:07.070
Actually, more like a significant other.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:09.660
<b>Boyfriend
Girlfriend</b>

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:09.660
<i>Sorry about my girlfriend.</i>

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.440
Thank you!

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:13.190
F-For what?!

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:17.920
<b>Episode 10: Socks and Summer Training Camp</b>

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.180
<b>Manga Club</b>

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.690
<b>1 day until our deadline!!</b>

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.940
1 day until
we submit 
our manuscript

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.440
It's crunch time for us.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:38.940
Manga Club President

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:42.170
We don't really need cheering, 
but we want you to watch over us.

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:43.200
Watch over you?

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.020
We haven't slept for two days...

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:47.830
But if we sleep, we'll be totally out, 
so if we start to fall asleep...

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.200
Wake us up with this.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:50.960
Huh?

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.920
Yes, you're right.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.050
I can see that happening.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.340
I don't think that's what 
she meant by "totally out."

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:09.290
<i>We're not going to be doing much, 
so I don't think we all need to be here.</i>

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:11.980
Wow! There are so many manga books!

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:13.920
The Four Great Kings are so cool.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:14.350
Peep?

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.130
I'll be watching over you, Kohane-san.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.360
Peep...

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:21.160
Oh, I've read that before.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.400
Really? Which one?

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.550
That one's great, isn't it?!

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:24.410
Y-Yes?!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.360
I know, right?!

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.020
They even made an anime of it! Wanna watch?

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:28.580
Look at the visual fan book!

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:35.830
There's a piano in this panel...

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.840
Piano

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:37.960
Who the hell thought there 
should be a piano here?

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:38.840
Wait, it was me!

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:42.060
There's a piano in the old music room.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:43.530
Would you like me to take you there?

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.920
Maybe we don't need the piano...

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.700
A third option!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:52.990
That won't work.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:55.930
Oh, well. I'll go take a picture of it.

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.680
Oh, so you are going to draw it.

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.610
If I skip it just because 
I'm bad at drawing them,

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.660
I'll never be able to draw them.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:04.860
I'll help!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.790
Hey, could you guys model for me?

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:15.620
<b>We draw portraits!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.350
I need you to hold hands like a couple.

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:15.050
Sure!

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:15.620
Huh?!

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:21.660
<i>Kohane... You didn't even 
hesitate for a second!</i>

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:28.260
This is the moment you fall in love... 
This is the moment you fall in love.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:31.460
Lovey-dovey... So lovey-dovey...

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:32.330
<i>And my excitement went down 
the drain in an instant...</i>

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.420
I thought that people who 
were good at drawing

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:38.400
could draw anything without 
even looking at it.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:41.940
Me, too. I guess that's not the case.

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:45.180
We can do other poses, too!

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:49.690
Then could you act like you're 
trying to grab something high up?

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:51.260
Like maybe that box up there.

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.220
Sure!

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:57.410
You might be a bit too... low.

00:05:58.390 --> 00:06:00.540
Uh, that's not what I meant...

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:02.670
Now could you link arms?

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:05.000
Next, could you hug her from behind?

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.440
We can even do a pose with all five of us!

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:11.430
I don't want to draw you all.

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:14.750
Then again... I asked you 
to just watch over us,

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.480
so I'm sorry to make you do all this.

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:19.190
It's fine. This is a way of supporting you.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.730
If you could have someone in the manga say

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.780
how great cheerleading is, that'll suffice.

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:27.300
<i>Is this all I've got?</i>

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:30.040
<i>But it's not over yet!</i>

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:34.030
<b>Cheer is awesome!</b>

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:31.500
<i>By the way...</i>

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.080
<i>Cheer is awesome!</i>

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.030
Just out of nowhere?!

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:39.210
I can't include cheer in the manga, 
but I'll draw you something in return.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.160
Wow, that's awesome!

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:43.140
How about a poster for your club?

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:45.460
What... was that thing?

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:47.630
It's a cat.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.690
Wait, it's not a dog?

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:53.050
Oh, I thought you had Akane-kun draw that...

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.480
It's a bunny.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.310
It's a bunny.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:01.130
I knew it was a bunny! That bunny's so cute!

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:02.810
Cute bun-bun!

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:10.320
Char... siu... ramen!

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:16.360
Is the beta section dried yet?

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:17.470
Erasing now!

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:19.200
I've finished applying the screentone!

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:20.360
Confirm the page count!

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:22.370
Also, make sure we didn't miss any dialogue!

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.900
These are good.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:24.460
These, too.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.080
Yes! We're done!

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.470
We did it!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.360
Congratulations!

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:36.160
Okay, now we can make another volume!

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:37.500
Manuscript! Manuscript!

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:39.450
Wait, you're drawing more?

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:42.670
We want to do everything we can right now.

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:43.770
Everything you can?

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:46.540
But you can barely sit up straight...

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:49.080
Oh, I'm fine.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.540
We love drawing manga.

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:55.690
Things are getting fun now.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.810
Thanks for all your support!

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:03.080
We'll handle the rest ourselves!

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:07.660
I'm so jealous.

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:09.760
Of how crazy they look?

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:13.050
I mean that they're doing 
everything they can!

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:18.970
The reason I started cheer was 
so that I could help people out.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:23.780
But it's not just that. I sort of 
want to face cheer head-on.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:27.350
Face cheer... head-on?

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.080
A coach?

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:31.120
All right, give it all you've got!

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:33.120
All you've got!

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:36.590
Explain it so someone as slow 
as Senpai can understand!

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:39.280
You realize you just dissed her, Kana-chan...

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:43.420
So you want to bring cheer 
to a whole new level?

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.480
Exactly! I knew you'd understand, Uki!

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:46.990
Bringing cheer to a new level!

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:49.480
Our hearts become one, and...

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:52.620
The special technique that comes from it!

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:55.300
That manga you read earlier 
is clearly influencing you...

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:56.360
Hmm.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:58.490
Then maybe a tournament is our next step.

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:02.440
In about a month, there's going 
to be a cheer tournament.

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:03.450
Really?

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:05.060
A tournament? That means...

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:07.020
Going at it with a friendly rival!

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.040
Heh, you're not bad!

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:11.860
And then, the Four Great 
Kings who stand in your way!

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:14.920
Forget about the manga already!

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:17.960
Are you going to be okay, Senpai?

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:22.580
If we try to aim higher with our 
cheerleading, it might be like... last time.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:27.570
I'm not sure if you've 
gotten over that incident.

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:31.290
What if trying to aim for the top 
makes things awkward again?

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:33.760
I'm worried that you might get hurt.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:37.390
You're right. I'm starting to 
feel like that might happen.

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:39.880
<i>I've heard of that before... 
It's called brainwashing!</i>

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:40.510
Are you okay? Are you okay?

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.270
No, it's all right.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:47.440
And we're not exactly aiming for the top.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:50.270
We're just going to do our best.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.840
Senpai...

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.960
Yeah! Let's do this!

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:57.940
By the way, Kohane-chan, have you 
gotten used to high places yet?

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.900
Huh? What?

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.800
What about high places?

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:06.250
Kohane's scared of heights.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.170
Huh?! Our top is scared of heights?!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.670
<b>Elevator</b>

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:11.710
How are we supposed to do an 
elevator or extension, then?!

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:11.710
<b>Extension</b>

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.660
I-I can get on an elevator...

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.930
Kohane-chan! Get a hold of yourself!

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:19.960
But...

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.180
I'll still do my best! I'll do special training!

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:26.800
It's almost summer vacation, 
so it might be beneficial if we

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:29.690
do a training camp and 
concentrate on training there.

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.040
A training camp!

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:35.760
<i>Training camps mean canteen curry.</i>

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:37.690
<i>Going to the beach in swimsuits!</i>

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.700
<i>Girl talk at night!</i>

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:43.600
Running on the beach is an 
excellent workout for your legs!

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.700
<i>Oh, this is the hardcore kind.</i>

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:50.210
<b>A/V Room</b>

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:50.210
Cheer Club
We'd love for you to join!!

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:50.210
But where can we hold the training camp?

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:56.390
Um...

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:01.530
My father's friend said we could 
use their dojo by the ocean.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:05.480
All right! We're having a training camp!

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:12.680
The ocean!

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.800
Hey, we're not going to the beach yet!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.760
K-Kohane-chan!

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:20.730
We need to greet the people 
we're staying with first.

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:22.610
<i>Well done...</i>

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:26.350
Jeez. We came here for a training camp.

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:28.840
You seem very committed, Hanawa-san.

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:30.040
That's wonderful.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.370
S-Senpai!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.770
Our goal this trip is cheer.

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:36.990
I have to wonder about any of you 
who are thinking of lazing around

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:38.940
and eating snacks all day.

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:44.560
I'm so... stupid!

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:46.510
What's the matter, Hanawa-san?!

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:49.530
No one told me I'd have to 
go on a trip with the girls

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:51.520
right after becoming their adviser...

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:53.150
Sensei!

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.360
No one told me about this!

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:57.740
We'll be there soon. Let's go.

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.770
This wasn't in my contract!

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:02.580
This is a shady club!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.130
Pardon me.

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:09.910
Coming!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.400
Oh, Hizume-chan!

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:14.170
Please, come on in.

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:18.080
I'm Inukai, the adviser of the cheer club.

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:20.390
Thank you for having us today.

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:27.550
<i>I know how to adult.</i>

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:29.080
Thank you for having us.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:33.060
Oh, Hizume-chan. You've grown 
up to be a beautiful young lady.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:35.850
Have you known each other a long time?

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:39.320
She used to come by with 
her father quite often.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:43.740
She said she was going to marry 
her father when she grew up.

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:45.450
She was absolutely adorable.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:48.880
Oh, you must forgive my blathering.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:50.160
Let me take you to your rooms.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.830
No, I'd love to hear more!

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.850
This is the dojo.

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:01.560
Wow, it's so pretty!

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:04.620
My husband is currently away 
with his students,

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:06.360
so use this place however you like.

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:09.510
Oh, also,

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:12.620
if you turn these panels around, 
there's a mirror on the other side.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:14.400
Is this some kind of ninja place?

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:17.320
Wow, that's so cool! It's a huge mirror!

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:18.360
High V!

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:20.810
This is great.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.740
I'm Mirrorman!

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:29.910
What are you, a grade-schooler?

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:33.640
I'll lay down some futons in the guest 
room, so you can all sleep there.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:35.790
Oh, I'll get them ready.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.670
<i>She just wants to sleep.</i>

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:42.540
All right, let's get started.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:44.750
Our goals for this training camp

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:47.100
are to get better for 
the upcoming tournament,

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:52.810
perfect each pose, and try new stunts.

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:57.020
<i>And I have one personal goal...</i>

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:59.340
Please be prepared!

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:03.400
<i>Is she glaring at me because
I wouldn't shut up about the past?</i>

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:06.140
<i>Though we said that we've made peace,</i>

00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:11.700
<i>I still feel a wall between 
Hanawa-san and me.</i>

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:15.860
<i>I'm going to tear down that 
wall during this training camp!</i>

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:19.910
Let's start with our stretches. 
Let's go, Hanawa-san.

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:26.030
<i>I'm way too excited...</i>

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:27.220
I'm okay with dying!

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:32.410
<i>D-Does she think I'm that cruel?</i>

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.570
<i>Of course she has a wall up, then!</i>

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:35.510
<i>In that case...</i>

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:39.580
<i>This should seem less menacing.</i>

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.730
Hey, is this a new arm motion?

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:47.990
Okay, next...

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:52.410
Let's give it a try while looking 
at ourselves in the mirror.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:53.740
Okay!

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:58.410
One, two, three, four, 
five, six, seven, eight.

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:02.730
Two, two, three, four, 
five, six, seven, eight.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:02.250
<i>I practiced quite a bit on my own.</i>

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:07.000
One, two, three, four, 
five, six, seven, eight.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:08.760
<i>I think I might look pretty 
cool and cute doing this!</i>

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.600
One, two, three, four, fi...

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:11.400
Meow!

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:15.950
What's the matter, Kotecchan? 
Am I your double now?

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.390
I'm so embarrassed!

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:19.760
It's important to feel that humility.

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:23.020
Get to know yourself better, 
and work toward improving that.

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:28.780
<i>It's important to know yourself as 
well as the one you're dealing with!</i>

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:31.400
<i>I should observe Hanawa-san, as well.</i>

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.320
<i>Her body looks a bit flushed.</i>

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:36.730
Senpai... You're so amazing. You're so cool.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:36.070
<i>Her red cheeks, her blank stare...</i>

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:40.470
<i>I understand now! She must have a cold.</i>

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.540
She doesn't understand at all

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:42.890
Hanawa-san!

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:43.900
Yes?!

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:46.360
Are you getting chills? Do you 
need another layer of clothing?

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:49.600
Are you all right? Your face is all red!
 Maybe you should rest for a bit!

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:49.600
What?! What?!

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:50.600
Hizume-chan.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:52.840
Do you have a moment?

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:53.910
Sure.

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:59.600
That was so nerve-racking.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:03.510
I can't shake the feeling that Senpai's 
been staring at me all morning.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:07.060
Now you know how it feels.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:11.550
What? Someone stared at you like that, Uki?

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:13.740
Well, aren't you popular?

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.950
Right. She's oblivious.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:19.490
Are you staring at me now?

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.900
Um, do you have a moment?

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:26.880
The matron wanted us to participate 
in an event tomorrow to liven it up.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:32.010
<b>Looking for participants!</b>

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:32.010
<b>Come on over to the Karat 
Beach Summer Festival!!</b>

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:30.490
She says they're worried they 
won't have enough participants.

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:32.010
What? An event?

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:35.550
This training camp is for us to improve,

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.500
but she <i>is</i> letting us stay here...

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:38.510
Yeah.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:42.640
Right now, we're total freeloaders.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.390
L-Let's do this thing!

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:46.860
But this is tomorrow.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.320
What are we going to do?

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:53.280
If we're going to be dancing on a stage, 
we have the routine we did at the park.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:57.290
But it'll be a new formation for Hanawa-san.

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:01.210
It's okay! I know it!

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:02.410
<i>How, though?</i>

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:06.250
That's wonderful! Let's put 
everything together, then!

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.920
<i>She's not calling her on that?!</i>

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:11.470
I guess you two are somehow communicating.

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:14.920
What?! But we haven't done anything yet!

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:18.040
What do you mean?

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:22.740
So you wanted to get closer with Hanawa-chan?

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:27.750
I felt a wall between us and thought 
she might be frightened of me.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:34.090
S-Senpai wants to...

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:33.300
Do people who are scared of 
you fall over from happiness?

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:39.850
Um... I'm not scared of you, Senpai!

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:42.240
You're so amazing! I admire you so much!

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:46.410
You're so good at cheer, 
you're so calm, and um, uh...

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:50.710
I still have a lot to improve on, 
and I'm a normal human being.

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:55.900
I know! Please accompany me 
throughout this training camp

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.720
and get to know the real me!

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.140
Together with Senpai...

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:03.200
Just the two of us...

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:07.640
Um... Maybe you shouldn't be alone 
with her. I think she might actually die.

00:18:08.070 --> 00:18:10.330
Then let's go to the beach!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:10.980
Huh?

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.090
Go for...

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.290
...win!

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:14.720
We'll let Mother Nature strengthen our bonds!

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:16.740
I think their lives are in danger there!

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:20.700
Well, since we're here, going to 
the beach might not be a bad idea.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.740
What? You, too?

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:24.990
Everyone,

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:27.510
please wear something you can run in.

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:29.610
Oh... We're running.

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:36.930
The ocean!

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:38.410
But...

00:18:39.070 --> 00:18:41.260
<b>Sneakers!!</b>

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.500
We're wearing sneakers 
with our swimsuits!

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:45.890
Good. There aren't too many people around.

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:50.010
Wait!

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:51.390
Hey, Hizume!

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:53.020
Senpai!

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.650
Wait...

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:03.930
Okay, we ran. Can we go in the water now?

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:06.460
Yes. I'm sure your bodies 
have loosened up now.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:07.900
All right!

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:09.320
Wait, Kohane!

00:19:09.320 --> 00:19:11.560
We need to reapply sunscreen first.

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:12.960
Oh, thanks!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:15.420
Could you help me with mine, too, Mom?

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.850
Want me to get your back, Mom?

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:19.130
Stop calling me Mom!

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.750
Shall I be the mom and help you out?

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.890
N-No! I'm fine!

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:27.770
I can't trouble you like that!

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:35.480
Don't worry. You'll eventually get closer.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:36.910
Do you really think so?

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:41.500
Well, I mean, when she calls you "Senpai," 
it's sort of like a nickname, right?

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:45.760
You're basically Kana's idol.

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:48.730
So when she's face to face 
with you, she gets nervous.

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:54.580
But in the end, that only 
happens because she likes you.

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:56.420
Senpai...

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:00.490
Likes me?! So it's not because 
she's scared to death of me?

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:01.420
To death?!

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:05.080
Senpai...

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:09.210
Hanawa-san!

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:10.810
Senpai?!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.330
Stop making things more confusing!

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:18.680
Aw, but I thought I'd take Hizume's 
spot and practice with you.

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:21.570
Like you could ever live up to Senpai!

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:24.450
Senpai is noble, and she smells wonderful.

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.990
When she smiles, flowers bloom,

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:31.000
birds sing, a gentle breeze blows, 
and the sky turns a deep blue.

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:33.710
Yeah, I don't see that happening.

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:38.190
I mean, even Hizume gets 
startled and hurt sometimes.

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:39.710
She's just a normal girl.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:47.350
I'd be hurt if my friend tried 
to distance herself from me.

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:51.680
Though I guess a girl who 
could make flowers bloom

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:53.890
might not get hurt.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.350
That's... not...

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:00.660
true...

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:08.620
Then you should walk beside her 
so you can get to know her better!

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:11.560
I think that's what Hizume's 
trying to do, too.

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:16.640
But it's hard to change the 
way I act after all this time.

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:18.890
I think you can just go about it gradually.

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:21.610
Yeah! Little by little!

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:23.760
Well, the old me...

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:26.260
would do a sliding grovel.

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:28.450
So now, I'll just do a normal grovel.

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:30.850
Let's try just a little harder than that.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:37.240
Is she so deathly nervous around me

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:40.750
because I'm too forceful or something?

00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:42.970
No, I promise it's not that.

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:43.990
But...

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:47.240
Hizume-senpai!

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:52.710
Um, if you want, I could 
put sunscreen on your back...

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:04.260
Thank you.

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.020
<b>Free</b>

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.020
<b>Dive in over here</b>

00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:41.620
Next time: "Exciting Shoulder Straddle."
